        "abstract": "The article highlights the demanding test challenges posed by artificial intelligence (AI) devices, particularly emphasizing the necessity for rigorous testing methodologies to ensure the performance and reliability of AI chips. As AI workloads become increasingly complex and data-intensive, and packaging advancements are driving new fault modes, traditional testing approaches are insufficient. The article underscores the need for multiple testing innovations, such as the integration of AI and machine learning for defect detection, the increased use of high-speed test interfaces, and the adoption of advanced thermal control solutions for test. These innovations offer comprehensive solutions to address the growing complexity and interdependency of modern AI semiconductors, enabling the semiconductor industry to keep pace with the rapid technological evolution and maintain high standards of performance and reliability in AI applications.",
