        "articleTitle": "How Will Artificial Intelligence Reshape the Semiconductor Industry?: Artificial Intelligence Meets Silicon: The Next Era of Chip Design and Manufacturing",
        "volume": "3",
        "issue": "1",
        "startPage": "12",
        "endPage": "14",
